        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maher Sabry, Til Schweiger, Hugo Stiglitz, Quentin Tarantino\n- Works: All My Life, Inglourious Basterds\n- Roles: theater director, playwright, film director, producer, screenwriter, poet, writer, cartoonist, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Til Schweiger, born 19 December 1963, is a German actor, director, and producer.\n- Maher Sabry, born 11 April 1967, is an Egyptian theater director, playwright, film director, producer, screenwriter, poet, writer, and cartoonist.\n- All My Life, also known as Toul Omry and Toute ma vie, is a 2008 Egyptian film by Maher Sabry.\n- Quentin Tarantino paid tribute to Hugo Stiglitz by naming a character Hugo Stiglitz, played by Til Schweiger, in Inglourious Basterds.",
